.SH BUGS
There is no
.B kernel/dev
package as such: each device server
.RB ( devfs ", " env ", " procfs ", " srv ", " sd ", " ether )
implements the node table and ctl convention on its own.
.IR dev (9)
describes the convention, not a shared library that enforces it.
